msgid ""
"You pasted a PRIVATE KEY. Only the PUBLIC KEY should be in DNS. Never share "
"your private key!"
msgstr ""
"Du har indsat en PRIVAT NØGLE. Kun den OFFENTLIGE NØGLE bør stå i DNS. Del "
"aldrig din private nøgle!"

#: lib/Module/DnsWizard/Service/DKIMWizard.php:225
msgid ""
"Public key appears to contain PEM headers (BEGIN/END). Only the base64 "
"content between headers is needed."
msgstr ""
"Offentlig nøgle ser ud til at indeholde PEM-headere (BEGIN/END). Kun base64-"
"indholdet mellem headerne er nødvendigt."

